      903   run ver-aht in this-procedure (output p-ver-aht) no-error .
      904    for each temp-oborot  : delete temp-oborot . end.
      905    for each temp-oborot1 : delete temp-oborot1 . end.
      906    for each temp-oborot2 : delete temp-oborot2 . end.
      907    find first x-analysis no-error .
      908   assign
      909     v-i[1] = 'r':U
      910     v-i[2] = 'c':U
      911     v-i[3] = 'b':U
      912     v-i[4] = 's':U
